	{
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"text"},
		line=1039,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010050"},
		line=1039,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"We arrive at the warehouses Kotone indicated.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Doesn't look like there's any guards.”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's too quiet. Are you sure this is the place?”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's believe in Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Khh!”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"I feel a piercing headache.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Just like last time.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"These irritating headaches always leave me with an incomprehensible sensation.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Akari?)”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"It feels like Akari is calling out to me from somewhere.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"But where?",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"I survey the row of identical-looking warehouses.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"There is nary a window on any of them.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Yet in spite of this, it is as though everything obstructing my vision has become transparent, allowing me to see all the way to the distant horizon.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"...Akari is here.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Her presence is unmistakably calling out to me, like a lone bonfire burning in the far reaches of the wilderness.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is the one.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh? What do you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She's in this one. I know it.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Akari is definitely here.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"I can't see her, but I can feel her presence all the same.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You take the back. I'll go in from the front.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"I draw my spellblade and approach the iron-reinforced door.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Within the darkness of night, the blade emits a hazy light.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"I faintly hear the hooting of an owl from the back entrance.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"It's Hotori's signal that she's in position.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Please be safe.)”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"I tightly grasp the door handle.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"I quickly scan around the bare warehouse entirely devoid of any cargo.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"There are no lights.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"The only source of illumination is the moon, casting its pale light through the solitary window onto the form of a single girl.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"She's sitting with her limbs tightly bound to a chair.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"It's Akari!",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"But the kidnapper is nowhere to be found.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"─This is a trap.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"My instincts scream in protest.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"If I approach her, both of us just might get blown to bits.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Even so, I have to make sure that she's safe.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"I make eye contact with Hotori, who came in from the back, and she monitors the surroundings while I cautiously approach Akari on my own.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"One careful step, then another...",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Less than ten meters separates us, but I close the distance at the pace of an ant.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"I strain my senses to their limit, but I can't detect any traps on the chair or on her person.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"I steel myself and close the final distance.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari! Akari!?”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"She doesn't seem to have any external injuries.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Could she just be sleeping?",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"I swiftly release Akari from her bonds.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nnm...”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"I hold Akari in my arms before she slips off the chair.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"There isn't so much as a scratch on her beautiful face.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(I'm sorry I took so long, Akari.)”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"I apologize from the depths of my heart as I look down at her long, downturned eyelashes.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Is she all right?”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. She's just unconscious.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Right. Thank goodness.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Contrary to her words, Hotori hasn't let down her guard.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This makes no sense. There's no trace of the kidnapper or any guards.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Whatever the case, we'd better get out of here.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, let's move.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"I hear the sound of approaching vehicles outside the warehouse.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"A rumbling sound that shakes the very floorboards.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Military vehicles. Four of 'em.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Hotori estimates the number of vehicles from the sound alone.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What's the Republican Army doing here?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Either it's a coincidence, or Akari's kidnapper called them over.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What's the plan?”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll draw their attention. You take Akari and get out of here.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll stay and fight as well.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Think about the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Hotori looks at me with a sorrowful expression.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Take care of Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Very well.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"I hand Akari over to Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Not a moment later─",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"A small object flies into the warehouse, smashing through the window.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"A blinding flash and a deafening explosion rob me of my senses.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Up! Break through the roof and escape!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"The instant after Hotori leaps upwards, another thunderous roar rips through the air.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Rgh!”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"A hail of bullets pierces through the shutter.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"I deflect what shots I can with my blade as I roll behind a pillar.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Several shots ricochet off the rebar and send sparks flying, illuminating the warehouse with flickers of light.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haah, haah... Opening up without even a warning?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Guh...”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"I feel a burning pain in my left arm, near the shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Thankfully, it seems to have missed any major arteries, but\nI'll still be in trouble if I can't stop the bleeding soon.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"I'll have to end this quickly...",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kuh?!”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"The shutter is sent flying.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We received a tip-off regarding a gathering of warriors armed with spellblades.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Lay down your arms and surrender at once, or we will neutralize you by force.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"The voice of the student council president fills the smoky air, amplified by a megaphone.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"I'll be damned if I'm going to surrender after they unloaded everything they've got at me already.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"It's either escape or die trying.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"I want to escape from above, but it'd be bad to take the same route as Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"That only leaves the back door.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"But as soon as I step out from the cover of the pillar, I'll get filled with more holes than imported Republican cheese.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"I throw a piece of rubble to one side, careful not to expose myself behind cover.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"A hail of fire follows the movement of the rubble.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"The opening will only last a split second.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"I leap out in the opposite direction of the rubble.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"I dash from pillar to pillar.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"If I can just make it to the back door, I'll be home free.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Just a bit farther...",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kuh?!”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"An inexplicable chill runs down my spine.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"I trust my instincts and twist my body, and a shot rips right past where my head was an instant earlier.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"The same distinctive pattern of gunfire relentlessly pursues me.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Among the enemies, only this person has managed to draw a bead on my movements.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"I'm reminded of a photograph I saw of the student council president winning an officers' shooting competition.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"I'd thought it was just a farce rigged for publicity, but it looks like her skills are the real deal.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"The bullets keep coming at me like lightning, and I continue dodging them by the skin of my teeth.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"Am I going to get pinned down, or will I manage to make my escape?",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Nary a moment of indecision separates this life and death outcome...",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"But fortune appears to have favored me today.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"The warehouse's side door comes within reach.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"I barrel through the door with all my weight.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"The moment my skin touches the cool outside air, I'm greeted by the steely sight of the business end of a claymore mine.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ngh...!”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"My vision swims before my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"One single moment.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"I managed to dodge just one single moment before it was too late.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"I barely evaded a certain death.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Even so, the entire right half of my body is reeling from the blood loss.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"It was all a trap.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"I'd thought I managed to dodge all of the president's shots.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"But she was leading me into her trap this whole time.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Seems like her marksmanship isn't the only exceptional quality about her.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Not yet... I can't afford to die yet...)”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"I reset the shoulder I hadn't even realized was dislocated.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Verify that the target has been neutralized.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We're dealing with a warrior here. Stay frosty.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"The president's sharp orders cut through the stillness.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"In short order, the enemy soldiers begin closing the distance with measured footsteps.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"I'll have to make the first move and catch them unawares.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Now!)”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"I leap forward before the first enemy makes it through the side of the warehouse.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soldier"},
			{
"“Ah?!”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"The soldier is caught wide-eyed.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"That's one down...",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Gh?!”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"My eyesight is blinded by an intense burst of light. Was it a floodlight? A flash grenade?",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"This is bad...",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"I head a dull burst of sound from overhead.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"In my flickering vision, I see a steel-webbed net falling to ensnare me.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"If it manages to pin me down, it's all over.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Enemy soldiers dead ahead, the warehouse to my left, and a wall to my back.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"I've run out of options.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ngh!”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Leaving myself wide open, I recklessly dive to the right with all my strength.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Fire!”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Anticipating my movement, a burst of gunfire is aimed right along my trajectory.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Fuuuuck!”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Like a man possessed, I kick off the ground and leap straight into the air.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"I see the warehouse and a swarm of enemy soldiers beneath my feet.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Gh!”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"I take in a sharp breath.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"More than twenty rifles are aimed my way.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"She read me like an open book...",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"I might be a warrior, but even we don't have wings.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"It's a fundamental law of physics that what goes up must eventually come down.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Just like shooting skeet.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"The guns roar out in unison.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"They let out a withering barrage of fire.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"A veritable wall of bullets races up to meet me.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"There's no way to dodge.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"My fate seems set in stone.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"But even so, I can't afford to die here.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"I put everything I have into the spellblade in my hands.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"My life.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"My pride as a warrior.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"My feelings for Akari.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Absolutely everything.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This shall not be...”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The end of meeeeee!”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Nnhh?!”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"My lightning-fast blade cleaves straight through the hail of bullets.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"Not even this wall of steel does anything to blunt my Sickle Leaf.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"It crashes into the ground and sends every last enemy soldier flying.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Gwaahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Unable to withstand the impact of my landing, one of my legs folds out from underneath me.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"This is bad. I can't afford to go down just─",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Gh!”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"A carefully aimed shot pierces through my left shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"I fall face-up, and the silhouette of a familiar girl is reflected in my vision.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Haah, haah, haah...”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"She takes aim squarely at me.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Perhaps the president is wounded herself, as her chest is heaving with every breath.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tokita-kun? I never expected it'd be you of all people...”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Think you could go easy... on a fellow classmate?”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Heh, as if.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Even I wouldn't be able to cover for a terrorist.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Besides, starting tomorrow, we won't be seeing you around at school any longer.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Does she intend to kill me here, or take me in and torture me?",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Either way, I suppose I can kiss my peaceful school life goodbye.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, I guess I don't need to call you 'president' anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Don't you think just 'Elsa' has a nice ring to it?”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"Elsa starts squeezing down on the trigger.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"There's no escape.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"But my eyes lock onto a fire hydrant next to Elsa, about to burst.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Eh?!”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Elsa is engulfed by a jet of spraying water.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Now's my chance.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Gh?!”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"I tackle Elsa and knock away her gun.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Khh...”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haah, haah... Looks like the tables have turned.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"I press my blade against Elsa's neck as she reaches for her gun.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You're a real monster, you know that?”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did you underestimate what a warrior is capable of?”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Certainly not; you're just out of the ordinary. A normal warrior would've died ten times over already.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Just like they did that fateful August.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Shut up.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"As I tighten my grip on the blade at her neck, I hear murmurs from the surroundings.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"The soldiers have finally recovered, and they're agitated at\nElsa's current predicament.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Order your men to drop their weapons.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"She glares at me without a word.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Didn't you hear me?!”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I said give the order to drop them!”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We don't negotiate with terrorists.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I admire your courage.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But Republican soldiers aren't heartless enough to sacrifice their commanding officer, are they?”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"I turn my gaze to the soldiers surrounding me.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Drop your weapons.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Don't listen to him. Open fire!”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The life of the governor-general's own daughter for a single warrior. Is that a fair trade?”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"After some hesitation, the soldiers throw down their guns one after another.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Khh...”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry, but it looks like everyone's too scared of your father. They're career soldiers, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And you're going to tell me that you're any different?”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"am",
{"/font"},
" different. A warrior fights only for the sake of fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And hatching terrorist plots in dark warehouses is your idea of fealty?”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I was only here by coincidence. I haven't done any of the things you're imagining.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You really think I'm going to buy that?”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Probably not, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Though you should know that if this were an ordinary situation, I wouldn't have spared anyone here, not even you.”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"Elsa's body stiffens at the sound of this.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But there are two reasons why I will.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“First, I'm completely innocent.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And second, I have faith that you'll believe in my innocence.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"Saying this, I let Elsa go.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"She immediately scrambles to her feet and turns a sharp glare at me.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“My, my. I didn't realize you were such an idealist.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I believe in your conscience, that's all.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We might stand on opposite sides, but I believe that you would never stray from the side of justice.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Justice? Don't make me laugh. That's nothing more than an idealistic delusion.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Don't you get it? ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"We're at war.",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Do you really think you can block bullets with your noble spirit? Kill the enemy with just some lofty ideals?”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Go ahead and get yourself killed on the battlefield believing in these virtues, for all they're good for.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's because you people believed in these things that the Empire lost. Don't you get it?”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"Elsa prattles on and on without a single pause.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"I meet her gaze and every last bit of the enmity it contains head-on.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I would rather die with my soul pure than live out the rest of my days as a beast.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's even more laughable...”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“There are no pure souls on the battlefield. Only masses of wicked desire in human form.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You got that right.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"I inexplicably break out into a natural smile.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"Yes, the battlefield is indeed hell.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"A place where madness reigns and ideals dare not tread.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“On the battlefield, dying is easier than drawing breath. For both beasts and humans alike.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And that is exactly why it is worth fighting...”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That we might test just how far we can go without staining our souls in blood and filth.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Since the very first, we warriors have fought with our lives to protect those very things you dare to call laughable.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"I've never had a way with words, but I unwittingly speak out nonetheless.",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"This isn't like me.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"I busy myself with sheathing my blade to distract from my embarrassment.",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If your conscience will permit it, you may come arrest me anytime.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But know that when you do, I will meet you with everything I have.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll keep it in mind...”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"I take one last look at Elsa's contorted expression, grimacing as though she's swallowed a bitter pill, before turning my back towards her for good.",
			},
		},
